    "implementation_delta": "Publish AccelerateFinalProofCarryingReceiptChain@1 as the Accelerate-owned hermetic final proof-carrying receipt chain against the PCPR-071 recovery CID baguqeerayeqc5tg3shtegpw56l4pn4uk5b7tw46jb32nrgtkdvq2oyukgirq, the PCPR-070 restart CID baguqeeratw2evha3sv4ko5km5e5igcjprwfpkse4x2siwa5ldhyu5ugbjyja, the PCPR-061 DatasetsContextPack@1 identity, the PCPR-062 Kit current root, the PCPR-063 route CID baguqeerab6vsy7orm6wmxmqbzqh5f57dasnufhgngvh47gw7g3whrkr5smga, the PCPR-064 patch CID baguqeeraphkktpgmcw2uusnbxlh7wfjblmhzb4oy3u55bbpdsvbt4xwvvb4q, the PCPR-065 run CID baguqeerazgo2lirhy7hrpa42j227gdpzmi3jl4jdajoz6jzqqx7td6fy7dpa, the PCPR-066 change CID baguqeeraowfymvuvscitvjkxn3sak6f4a2ctkfvflney26jen7gwyqplln6a, the PCPR-067 reuse CID baguqeera75dkjwczh6mehnwyqot25rbd2mazkgjuvb4lrvkdkuqo7vntieuq, the PCPR-068 interface CID baguqeera3k54j374af37kxdvkfgkjdfdofbdtg3x5vckpsceemy4lyklw3dq, and the PCPR-069 delta CID baguqeerahbxnuho3jdzkwaar6yx4ers7ns3p73mm3ghhgc5mhmn5r2fg3pga. The chain independently validates semantics, stores artifacts hermetically, and emits a hermetic ExecutionReceipt. Objective, context, epoch, task, proof, storage, event, compatibility, and result identities link. Replaying the same chain command yields chain CID baguqeeraeuvfodvledfa4nvfuso6eyyytzk2acptcogzwzyarkdinpqcsdfq and is rejected as a duplicate effect. Stale leases and fences cannot authorize the chain. Owner generation stays at 2. Plan epoch stays at 2. Continuation proceeds without database edits. LogicProviderProtocol@2 is not reminted. DatasetsFinalReceiptChainBinding@1 and KitFinalReceiptChainBinding@1 consume the Accelerate chain without reminting pack, current-root, route, patch, run, change, reuse, interface, delta, restart, or recovery identities. Live Quack chain emission, live supervisor application, and START stay typed unavailable. Missing a live Quack-fenced session emits operator-blocking task pcpr-072-operator-live-final-receipt-chain. This evaluator never writes DuckDB or Quack state and never emits a closed PCPR release outcome."
